{title: 261 - The Spirit of the Lord Revealed}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #261 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 261}
{meta: category Holy Spirit - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]The Spirit [Gm]of [F]the [C/E]Lord [Dm]revealed [C]His [C7/Bb]will [F/A]to [Gm]saints [F]ofold;
[C]Their heart [F]and mind and [Am]lips [Gm]unsealed [F]His [C/E]glory [Dm]to [G/B]unfold.
[C7/Bb]Amid [F/A]the [Gm]gloom [F]of [Bb]ancient [F]night They [Dm]hailed the [Gm/Bb]dawning [Dm]Word,
[Gm]And in [C]the [Dm]coming [D7/C]of [Gm/Bb]the [Am]light Proclaimed [C]the comingLord.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]The [Am]prophets [C/E]passed; [G/B]at [C7/Bb]length [F/A]there came
[F]To [Gm]sojourn [G/B]and [C7/Bb]abide,
[C]The [F]Word incarnate, [C/E]to [Dm]whose [G/B]name
[C]The [F]prophets [C/E]testified;
[C7/Bb]And [F/A]He, the [Bb]twilight [Dm]overpast,
[C7/Bb]Himself, [Bb]the [F]Light [Dm]of light,
[Gm]As [C]man [Dm]with [D7/C]man, [Am]revealed [C]at [Dm]last
[Gm]The [C]Father [Am]to [Gm]our [Dm]sight.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Eternal [C/E]Spirit, [C7/Bb]who [F/A]dost speak
[F]To [Gm]mind [C/E]and [G/B]conscience [Gm]still,
[C]That [F]we in [Am]this [F]our [C/E]day, [Dm]may [G/B]seek
[C]To [F]do [Am]our [F]Father's [G/B]will,
[C7/Bb]To [F/A]us the [Bb]word [F]of [Dm]life [Gm/Bb]impart,
[C7/Bb]Of [Gm]Christ, [Bb]the [F]living [Dm]way;
[Gm]Give [C]us [Dm]the [Gm/Bb]quiet, [Am]humble [Dm]heart
[Gm]To [C]hear [D7/C]and [Am]to [Gm]obey.
{end_of_verse}
